{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/757922-what-did-you-guys-think-of-alice-through-the-looking-glass","id":757922,"title":"What did you guys think of Alice Through the Looking Glass ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-05T21:22:30-08:00","id":757922,"title":"What did you guys think of Alice Through the Looking Glass ?","content":"I just saw the trailer for Alice Through the Looking Glass and I found it really interesting. The time guy I thought would make a great angel but anyway I wanted to know what you guys think of it.. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WovwuOFBUuY\" data-code=\"WovwuOFBUuY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WovwuOFBUuY/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T15:36:12-08:00","id":760984,"title":"","content":"Honestly I'm cautiously excited; it will probably be good but I'm just waiting for the moment when that White Queen lady from the first movie snaps and ends up being a villain.<br /> She just... really creeps me out and I am not sure <i>why</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8495-peachyjams","name":"PeachyJams","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8495_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-14T18:58:51-08:00","id":765969,"title":"","content":"<br /> <br /> *reads thread title* I love Alice in Wonderland and Through the... *clicks thread*<br /> <br /> Oh. That.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T09:39:14-08:00","id":767879,"title":"","content":"This looks... exactly like the first movie. I mean, same basic story and everything. &quot;Oh Alice, you being away meant that everything went to shit. Oh Alice, there's some big prophecy about what you need to do. Look Alice, look at the Mad Hatter staring mournfully out over a generic devastated landscape.&quot; I can't actually tell if some of this is supposed to actually be footage from the previous movie (that bit with a Jabberwock looking thing shooting a blast from the mouth stands out); it's either a trailer obtusely using footage not in the movie, or the actual film will be repeating something as overt as the Jabberwock, and that seems like poor form on either count.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T09:44:56-08:00","id":767887,"title":"","content":"It looks like Tim Burton still hates the Alice stories.<br /> <br /> I can say that because he has stated in interviews he does not actually like the Alice stories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T10:13:52-08:00","id":767916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/757922-what-did-you-guys-think-of-alice-through-the-looking-glass?p=767887#post767887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It looks like Tim Burton still hates the Alice stories.<br /> <br /> I can say that because he has stated in interviews he does not actually like the Alice stories.</div> </div> </div> </div>What is it with this guy and making movies from sources he apparently doesn't even like? It was the same with Batman, if memory serves. <br /> <br /> Also, on topic, I'm not hyped. I didn't like the first one because it was basically a PG-Rated version of American McGees Alice which was okay enough in my books. But then again, anything that adds a cohesive storyline to Alice in Wonderland is met with skepticism from my side.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}